# B-349: arity checker respects default-valued parameters as optional.
# A function with a default-valued param must be callable with and without that param.
# Before fix: calling without the optional param produced a spurious arity-mismatch error.
[
  greet: [fn@String [let name@String n@[type: Int  default: 3]]
    [str name "!" [str n]]]

  # Omitting the optional param — was previously an arity-mismatch error.
  r1: [greet "Alice"]

  # Supplying both params — must work as before.
  r2: [greet "Bob" 5]
]
=== out
Dict({"greet": Function(name, n), "r1": String("Alice!3"), "r2": String("Bob!5")})
